<title>USA: Comdisco to split stock, raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Comdisco to split stock, raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdisco Inc said Monday it will split its stock on a three-for-two basis and that it will raise its quarterly cash dividend.</p>
<p>The quarterly payout will be raised to $0.075 a share from $0.070 on a pre-split basis, the technology services company said.  </p>
<p>The common stock split will be effected on June 16, to stockholders of record as of May 23, Comdisco said.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be payable June 16, to stockholders of record on May 23, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
